16471	“The world as we have created it is a process of our thinking. It cannot be changed without changing our thinking.”	Albert Einstein	change, deep-thoughts, thinking, world	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16472	“It is our choices, Harry, that show what we truly are, far more than our abilities.”	J.K. Rowling	abilities, choices	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16473	“There are only two ways to live your life. One is as though nothing is a miracle. The other is as though everything is a miracle.”	Albert Einstein	inspirational, life, live, miracle, miracles	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16474	“The person, be it gentleman or lady, who has not pleasure in a good novel, must be intolerably stupid.”	Jane Austen	aliteracy, books, classic, humor	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16475	“Imperfection is beauty, madness is genius and it's better to be absolutely ridiculous than absolutely boring.”	Marilyn Monroe	be-yourself, inspirational	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16476	“Try not to become a man of success. Rather become a man of value.”	Albert Einstein	adulthood, success, value	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16477	“It is better to be hated for what you are than to be loved for what you are not.”	André Gide	life, love	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16478	“I have not failed. I've just found 10,000 ways that won't work.”	Thomas A. Edison	edison, failure, inspirational, paraphrased	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16479	“A woman is like a tea bag; you never know how strong it is until it's in hot water.”	Eleanor Roosevelt	misattributed-eleanor-roosevelt	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
16480	“A day without sunshine is like, you know, night.”	Steve Martin	humor, obvious, simile	54023618-149a-4c54-a92d-11495093e004	2025-05-12 20:08:01.253554
